// Generated companion and boss portraits (trial batch, v2, Derek Nov 23, 2026).
// v2 replaces the v1 flat-cartoon set: detailed epic fantasy style
// (Lord of the Rings / God of War / Elden Ring / Eragon), weathered,
// serious faces, realistic shading. Static images only: companions and
// bosses need no customization, so there is no recolour, hair, armor, or
// style picker for these, unlike the guardian. Each image is a
// head-and-shoulders cutout of the generated figure on a plain white
// background: near-white connected to the border was removed (PIL +
// scipy), the figure trimmed, resized to a 400px longest side, and saved
// as transparent WebP q70. The Mirror of Doubt is the exception: its
// crop is the hooded figure inside the mirror, and the grey-blue mirror
// glass is kept opaque as its background. The Slump crop is wider so its
// Z's and sleepy face both read at 56px. SVG portraits in
// CompanionAvatar.tsx stay as the fallback for every companion and boss
// without a generated image here.

